cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset or code, please cite the paper.
title: hui-emg-imu-gesture
abstract: >-
  A multimodal gesture dataset and cross-user benchmark. Eleven subjects were recorded over five
  sessions wearing a nine-channel forearm EMG band and an upper-arm IMU, performing eleven arm
  commands and five finger-counting postures. The repository provides the recording, a
  session-separated one-shot enrollment protocol, and implementations of the adaptation methods
  compared in the paper.
type: dataset
authors:
